  "visualBrief": "A projecting entrance gable shelters carved posts and painted openings. Corrugated metal laps out beneath the straw on the two roof wings. Four roof ranges surround the open court. Its canopy has paired sculpted supports and a smaller figure beside its right post. A sagging fiber fringe hangs between the inner carved posts above the rounded stone treads. The two entrance jambs swell unevenly into the approach, connecting the weathered base to the lintel. Worn grey paving surrounds the small canopy. The recessed portal has narrow wrought-iron scroll panels beside its central square grid.",
